Package: niceSMD
Title: Descriptive Tables with Variable Level Standardized Differences
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Hyejung", "Lee", role = c("aut", "cre"), email =
             "hyejung.lee@utah.edu")
Description: Creates descriptive tables for unweighted data, nonnegative
             analysis weights, and survey designs. Reports one absolute
             standardized mean difference per variable for a selected pair of
             groups, including a generalized difference for multilevel
             categorical variables. Separates calculations from display labels
             and exports editable Word tables.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: flextable (>= 0.9.5), officer (>= 0.6.0), stats, survey (>= 4.1),
             tableone (>= 0.13.2)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/hyejung0/niceSMD
BugReports: https://github.com/hyejung0/niceSMD/issues
